    "html": "<p>The table below provides the nucleon number (<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"A\"></span>) and the approximate nuclear radius (<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"R\"></span>) for an oxygen-16 nucleus and an unknown nucleus.</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Nucleus</th><th>Nucleon number (<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"A\"></span>)</th><th>Nuclear radius (<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"R\"></span>) / fm</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Oxygen-16</td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"16\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3.0\"></span></td></tr><tr><td>Unknown</td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"X\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"6.0\"></span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Based on the data in the table, what is the most likely nucleon number <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"X\"></span> for the unknown nucleus?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"32\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"64\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"128\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"256\"></span></p></li></ol>"
